%% Position monitoring — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Position[Ledger position / thesis lots] --> Monitor[Deterministic monitor]
  Market[Fresh market / feature snapshots] --> Monitor
  Clock[Session clock / deadlines] --> Monitor
  Monitor -->|No trigger| Record[Record monitoring watermark]
  Monitor -->|Material new evidence| AI[Bounded AI re-analysis]
  AI --> Evidence[Validated thesis evidence]
  Evidence --> Monitor
  Monitor -->|Stop / target / time / invalidation| Exit[Deduplicated Exit Proposal]
  Exit --> Workflow[Portfolio / mode / risk / execution]
  Workflow --> Fill[Paper fill]
  Fill --> Ledger[Ledger update]
  Ledger --> Position

  Controls[Entry Halt / suspended Pod retain monitoring] --> Monitor
